# lesskey source -- less's keys on the UKRAINIAN layout too.
#
# less (git log, git diff, `keys`, ...) reads letters, not key positions, so
# with the Ukrainian layout on, "d" arrives as "в" and nothing happens. Each
# line below binds the Cyrillic letter on the SAME key cap to the same command
# as the Latin one.
#
# Portable (plain lesskey source, needs less >= 582). Used by:
#   Windows -- install.ps1 -Configs deploys it to ~\.config\cli_tweaks\lesskey,
#              the pwsh profile points $env:LESSKEYIN at it (Git for Windows
#              ships less 668).
#   Ubuntu  -- install-configs.sh deploys it to ~/.config/cli_tweaks/lesskey,
#              .bashrc points $LESSKEYIN at it (Ubuntu 24 ships less 590).
#
# Arrows, PgUp/PgDn, Space, Home/End already work on any layout.

#command
в       forw-scroll        # d   half a page down
г       back-scroll        # u   half a page up
а       forw-screen        # f   a page down
и       back-screen        # b   a page up
о       forw-line          # j   a line down
л       back-line          # k   a line up
у       forw-line          # e
н       back-line          # y
п       goto-line          # g   to the top
П       goto-end           # G   to the bottom
.       forw-search        # /   search  (that key types "." on the UA layout)
,       back-search        # ?   search backwards (Shift+/ types ",")
т       repeat-search      # n   next match
Т       reverse-search     # N   previous match
р       help               # h
й       quit               # q
Й       quit               # Q
